{"lyrics":"[Intro: Juice WRLD]\n[00:03.08]Have you ever fallen head over heels for somebody?\n[00:08.54]Not just somebody\n[00:11.30]No, no\n[00:11.80](Rex, you did it again)\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD]\n[00:13.28]Have you ever fallen head over heels for somebody\n[00:16.58]That made promises to give you the world? Um\n[00:19.36]I really hope they held you down\n[00:21.30]I really hope it was no lying\n[00:23.22]'Cause when heart breaks it feel like the world's gone\n[00:26.36]But if the love's real, you'd feel your soul roar like a lion\n[00:30.00]And you'd finally let bygones be bygones\n[00:32.66]Don't throw in the towel, I know it feels like you're the only one trying\n[00:36.68]You just gotta learn to live and love on\n[Pre-Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:40.72]I belong with the one put on this Earth for me\n[00:43.88]Everybody has their someone, just gotta look and see\n[00:47.22]I'm screaming out, \"Lord, help me, I've been lonely\"\n[00:50.04]That's when you accept me, then you set me free\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[00:53.54]Uh, sometimes life's a mess\n[00:57.94]Uh, I get high when I'm upset\n[01:00.76]I remember when me and love didn't click\n[01:04.34]Searchin' for somethin' real, then I found it\n[01:08.58]Uh, sometimes life's a mess\n[01:10.40]Yeah, I get high when I'm upset\n[01:14.08]I remember when me and love ain't click\n[01:17.58]Lookin' for somethin' real, then I found it\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:20.36]Been pretty fuckin' bad, but it's better now\n[01:23.84]Through the trials and tribulations, I found my way out\n[01:26.56]Feel all of the good and bad vibrations all around\n[01:30.86]All around us, they surround us\n[01:34.10]Was a lost cause with some lost love\n[01:37.72]It ain't my fault, pain chose us\n[01:40.84]Then I found her\n[01:42.54]My whole world turned upside down, uh\n[01:45.66]But for the better\n[Pre-Chorus: Juice WRLD]\n[01:47.90]I belong with the one put on this Earth for me\n[01:51.00]Everybody has their someone, just gotta look and see\n[01:54.30]I'm screaming out, \"Lord, help me, I've been lonely\"\n[01:57.22]That's when you accept me, then you set me free\n[Chorus: Juice WRLD & Halsey]\n[01:59.48]Uh, sometimes life's a mess\n[02:03.36]Uh, I get high when I'm upset\n[02:07.88]I remember when me and love didn't click\n[02:11.46]Searchin' for somethin' real, then I found it\n[02:15.36]Uh, sometimes life's a mess\n[02:18.20]Yeah, I get high when I'm upset\n[02:21.02]I remember when me and love ain't click\n[02:24.70]Lookin' for somethin' real, then I found it\n[Outro: Halsey]\n[02:41.70]Thank God I finally found you\n[02:44.86]You put the light in my eyes when I'm around you\n[02:48.08]I'm too flawed to hold you down, but\n[02:51.68]Don't wanna be here alone\n[02:53.60]And I thank God I finally found you\n[02:57.84]I'll put the light in your eyes if I'm allowed to\n[03:01.38]I'm too flawed to hold you down, but\n[03:05.04]Don't let me be here alone","words":[[3.08,3.3,"Have"],[3.36,3.44,"you"],[3.58,3.8,"ever"],[3.9,4.28,"fallen"],[4.36,4.54,"head"],[4.64,4.88,"over"],[4.98,5.32,"heels"],[5.4,5.62,"for"],[5.8,6.34,"somebody?"],[8.54,8.72,"Not"],[8.82,9.14,"just"],[9.18,10.12,"somebody"],[11.3,11.36,"No,"],[11.46,11.58,"no"],[11.8,12.48,"(Rex,"],[12.58,12.62,"you"],[12.72,12.9,"did"],[12.96,13.02,"it"],[13.08,13.22,"again)"],[13.28,13.34,"Have"],[13.38,13.44,"you"],[13.64,13.84,"ever"],[13.98,14.32,"fallen"],[14.4,14.62,"head"],[14.74,14.94,"over"],[15.04,15.4,"heels"],[15.44,15.66,"for"],[15.86,16.4,"somebody"],[16.58,16.68,"That"],[16.72,16.78,"made"],[16.9,17.54,"promises"],[17.58,17.64,"to"],[17.8,18.02,"give"],[18.06,18.14,"you"],[18.22,18.3,"the"],[18.4,18.72,"world?"],[19.02,19.08,"Um"],[19.36,19.36,"I"],[19.46,19.72,"really"],[19.84,20.0,"hope"],[20.06,20.2,"they"],[20.28,20.46,"held"],[20.52,20.6,"you"],[20.72,21.12,"down"],[21.3,21.3,"I"],[21.38,21.62,"really"],[21.74,21.98,"hope"],[22.04,22.1,"it"],[22.14,22.28,"was"],[22.38,22.48,"no"],[22.78,23.16,"lying"],[23.22,23.38,"'Cause"],[23.42,23